BuildEnvironment

> Experimental: ASPIREEXTENSION001 - Learn more (https://aspire.dev/diagnostics/aspireextension001/)

• Name: BuildEnvironment                                                                                                                       
• Modifiers: virtual get                                                                                                                       
• Returns: IReadOnlyDictionary<string, string>                                                                                                 
• Source: GitHub (https://github.com/microsoft/aspire/blob/b33d222049f1ecc3bc7257ec07b622fe550b2580/src/Aspire.Hosting/IProjectMetadata.cs#L44)

Gets the resolved environment variables that affected an externally produced build.

public virtual IReadOnlyDictionary<string, string> BuildEnvironment { get; }

Remarks

IDE launchers use these values when evaluating build properties such as TargetPath. These values are not a secret transport and can appear in build diagnostics and IDE launch metadata.

