• Source: GitHub (https://github.com/microsoft/aspire/blob/b33d222049f1ecc3bc7257ec07b622fe550b2580/src/Aspire.Hosting/IProjectMetadata.cs#L54)

Gets the working directory used by an externally produced build.

public virtual string? BuildWorkingDirectory { get; }

Remarks

IDE launchers use this directory to select the same .NET SDK and repository configuration as the external build.

